; ========================================
; ＞『水精の間』を選択
; ========================================

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_5_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0
@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛走进招待所之中<br>位处中部的【水精之室】。|#0103Adv21_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:由于火灾并未波及这里，<br>房间仍保持着原样。|#0103Adv21_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（这里好像什么都没有……）|#0103Adv21_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyCamera Offset:0,-2 Zoom:0.5 EasingTypeName:SmoothStep Duration:0.9 Lazy:false
@Wait WaitMode:0.9

[PrintTextModified Text:（有一座典狱长的雕像……）|#0103Adv21_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛想着，并伸手触碰雕像时，<br>雕像失去平衡，差点倒下。|#0103Adv21_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:哇！？|#0103Adv21_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛急忙扶住雕像，小心翼翼地松开手。|#0103Adv21_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCamera Offset:0,0 Zoom:0 EasingTypeName:SmoothStep Duration:0.9 Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:"（……这座雕像的重心似乎不太稳定。<br>　是制作的问题吗……？）|#0103Adv21_Ema004|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; ☆証拠品：『ゴクチョーの像』入手
; ========================================
@SpawnExtended Path:Clue Params:3-6
@UpdateWitchBook Id:3-6 Category:Clue Version:1
@DestroySpawnedExtended Path:Clue LogWarning:true

[PrintTextModified Text:之后，艾玛简单搜查了一下室内，但没有发现特别的线索，<br>便离开了建筑。|#0103Adv21_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

